# Announcement on Commercial Billing for the Sandbox Function Snapshot Feature
Effective from 00:00 (Beijing Time) on September 7, 2026, the Snapshot feature for Sandbox Functions will officially be subject to commercial billing.

## Feature Overview
The Snapshot feature supports full-state snapshots (including memory and disk) of running sandboxes. Based on these snapshots, you can restore a sandbox within seconds or clone multiple new sandboxes. This is suitable for scenarios such as resuming long-running agent tasks from breakpoints, achieving second-level cold starts through environment pre-warming, and parallel cloning for exploration.

## Pricing
```text
Snapshot Storage Usage = Memory Specification * 2 + Disk Specification
Cost = Snapshot Storage Usage * Disk Unit Price * Duration

Disk Unit Prices:
- Mainland China: CNY 0.0021 per GiB per hour
- Overseas Regions: CNY 0.001672 per GiB per hour
```

## Impact on Existing Snapshots
Snapshots created before the introduction of commercial billing will officially incur charges starting from 00:00 on September 7. Please delete or retain them as needed.
